      "rationale": {
        "summary": "Three pursuers (one type 284, two Frowning Gapers type 10.0) approach from the lower half; player is at the open right side with full health, normal tears (3.5 dmg, effective range ~195 px) and no enemy projectiles currently on the floor. Standard profile holds a right-side lateral lane at 0.5-0.85 of tear range, which keeps all three bodies outside contact reach while preserving a cardinal horizontal firing line, and strafes so the player is not standing where the creep trail is laid. Predictive aim with 12-tick lead suits slow walkers; threat_first prioritizes the ranged type-284 enemy while finish_first switches in once pressured. Presurred profile (health <= 50% or nearest target closer than 35% of range) trades damage uptime for clearance and a wider retreat corridor, since a kill can leave a Pacer or Gusher and re-create the pressure. Only allowed actions are move and shoot; no items, bombs or inventory use. Type 284 mechanics remain unconfirmed by lookup (status unknown), so its behavior is treated as unverified and replanning is armed on new_enemy_mechanism.",
